	(text "Amplifier for the shunt path. It senses the FPGA side of the shunt (net VCCINT; Kelvin trace from the BGA side of the shunt), AC-coupled above 16 kHz.\nTwo stages of x10: the outputs deliver x5 (14 dB) and x50 (34 dB) into a 50 ohm scope input; with the 20 mohm shunt about 0.15 V/A and 1.5 V/A at low frequency.\nUse it with the SHUNT or the INDUCTOR path; remove the AMP jumper when it is not needed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "29417126-e5a2-593d-918a-f311dba526f7")
	)
